.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
# Build artefacts created by `uv tool install` / `pip install` / `uv build`.
# Regenerated on every install, never committed.
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store
._*
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
# mcpbrain/google_oauth_client.json is the tenant's OAuth desktop client. It is
# NOT committed: this repo is PUBLIC (it was described here as private, which had
# stopped being true), and the client is the one genuinely private part of a
# tenant profile. It lives in the private mcpbrain-tenant repo and is copied in by
# `python bin/tenant.py use ../mcpbrain-tenant`, which bin/release.py requires
# before it will build. mcpbrain/tenant.json holds no secrets and IS committed.
mcpbrain/google_oauth_client.json
google_token.json
google_account
client_secret.json

# Per-user local state from the Claude Code "remember" skill — session
# transcripts, log lines, scratch files. Not part of the shipped repo.
.remember/

# Daemon runtime artefacts that may land beside the data dir if MCPBRAIN_HOME
# is ever pointed at the repo (it shouldn't be, but ignore defensively).
control_port
control_token
daemon.lock
*.mcpbrain.log
*.mcpbrain.err
enrich_queue/
enrich_inbox/
